                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Glitch’s Trip\n~~~~~~~~~\n\nWelcome to Glitch’s trip; are your platforming skills honed to that of Ninja status? You shall soon find out in Glitch’s Trip. Join Glitch our protagonist as they run, jump, climb, shoot and use their ability to glitch between the foreground and background of the world. Just as you think you have mastered this adventure, the game ups the stakes, as progress for you also means more advanced enemies and terrain as you journey deeper and deeper into the game.\n\nGlitch’s Trip\n\nReleased in Feb. 2018 by Ransacked Studios, LLC in Early Access Glitch’s Trip is a Hardcore 2D Action Indie Title that will test your platforming skills. Being an Early Access title the game is still growing, so you can expect a lot more features & levels as the developers work towards final release. They have a solid game in place now, with 2 worlds completed out of 4 planned, with a total of 50 levels currently in game. So get ready for an action-packed adventure - Good Luck and Happy Platforming!\n\nYou begin your first level in a tutorial area to familiarize yourself with the controls of the game.\nAs you progress, levels increase in difficulty in the ever-changing world in which you traverse.\nUse Glitch’s power to teleport from the foreground to the background and avoid bullets; this alters the 2D world to progress and protect yourself. The vibrant graphics, level design, and unique soundtrack have already shown that Ransacked Studios may be an upcoming Indie Developer in the ranks on Steam.\n\nWe really have enjoyed Glitch’s Trip; as I was playing, one of my sons wanted to challenge me with his platformer skills. I do admit, it is harder these days to keep up with these young gamers.\nWe had a riot competing for the fastest times! The game’s vibrant art style and 2D world are well designed with a soundtrack that doesn’t overpower the game. The game is fast, fun and full of action, with some levels being a little easier (just to drop you into the next), which leaves you wondering how Hardcore this can get as you master manipulating the game.\n\nPro’s:\n+Vibrant Graphics\n+Steam Achievements\n+Challenging Gameplay\n+Fair Price\n\nCon’s\n-No Trading Cards\n-Only has 50 levels currently (More to Come :D)\n\nScore 8/10\n\nGlitch’s Trip: A Vibrantly Stunning 2D Hardcore Platformer Experience!\n\n[quote]Key provided by developer/publisher for review purposes. Any opinions expressed are entirely my own.[/quote]",
